                                              <http://vitro.mannlib.cornell.edu/ns/vitro/0.7#descriptionAnnot> "Public description modified from the information on this page: http://www.w3.org/TR/2005/WD-swbp-skos-core-guide-20050510/#sechierarchy ." ;
                                              rdfs:label "broader concept"@en .


