###  http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeFAOSTAT
<http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeFAOSTAT> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                       <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#sourceCreator> "FAOSTAT" ;
                                                       <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#sourceIdentifier> "http://faostat.fao.org"@en ,
