                                      rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/identifier> ;
                                      rdfs:domain [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                    owl:unionOf ( <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Collection>
                                                                  <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Document>
                                                                )
                                                  ] ;
                                      rdfs:range rdfs:Literal ;
                                      <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> """CODEN became particularly common in the scientific community as a citation system for periodicals cited in technical- as well in chemistry-related publications and as a search tool in many bibliographic catalogues.
