###  http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#bbox
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#bbox> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                 rdfs:domain <http://purl.org/dc/terms/Location> ;
                                 rdfs:range rdfs:Literal ;
                                 rdfs:comment "Den geografiske omskrevne firkant af en ressource."@da ,
                                              "El cuadro delimitador geográfico para un recurso."@es ,
                                              "Il riquadro di delimitazione geografica di una risorsa."@it ,
                                              "Ohraničení geografické oblasti zdroje."@cs ,
                                              "The geographic bounding box of a spatial thing [SDW-BP]."@en ;
                                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/> ;
                                 rdfs:label "bounding box"@da ,
                                            "bounding box"@en ,
                                            "cuadro delimitador"@es ,
                                            "ohraničení oblasti"@cs ,
                                            "quadro di delimitazione"@it ;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property added in DCAT 2."@en ,
                                                                                  "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 2."@cs ,
                                                                                  "Nuova proprietà aggiunta in DCAT 2."@it ,
                                                                                  "Ny egenskab tilføjet i DCAT 2."@da ,
                                                                                  "Propiedad nueva agregada en DCAT 2."@es ;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Den geografiske omskrevne firkant af en ressource."@da ,
                                                                                  "El cuadro delimitador geográfico para un recurso."@es ,
                                                                                  "Il riquadro di delimitazione geografica di una risorsa."@it ,
                                                                                  "Ohraničení geografické oblasti zdroje."@cs ,
                                                                                  "The geographic bounding box of a spatial thing [SDW-BP]."@en ;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "English language definitions and comments updated in this revision in line with ED. Multilingual text unevenly updated."@en ;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "El rango de esta propiedad es intencionalmente genérico con el propósito de permitir distintas codificaciones geométricas. Por ejemplo, la geometría puede ser codificada como WKT (geosparql:wktLiteral [GeoSPARQL]) o [GML] (geosparql:asGML [GeoSPARQL])."@es ,
                                                                                 "Il range di questa proprietà (rdfs:Literal) è volutamente generica, con lo scopo di consentire diverse codifiche geometriche letterali. Ad esempio, la geometria potrebbe essere codificata con un letterale WKT (geosparql:wktLiteral [GeoSPARQL]) o [GML] (geosparql:asGML [GeoSPARQL])."@it ,
                                                                                 "Obor hodnot této vlastnosti je úmyslně obecný, aby umožnil různé kódování geometrií. Geometrie by kupříkladu mohla být kódována jako WKT (geosparql:wktLiteral [GeoSPARQL]) či [GML] (geosparql:asGML [GeoSPARQL])."@cs ,
                                                                                 "Rækkevidden for denne egenskab er bevidst generisk defineret med det formål at tillade forskellige kodninger af geometrier. Geometrien kan eksempelvis repræsenteres som WKT (geosparql:asWKT [GeoSPARQL]) eller [GML] (geosparql:asGML [GeoSPARQL])."@da ,
                                                                                 "The range of this property (rdfs:Literal) is intentionally generic, with the purpose of allowing different geometry literal encodings. E.g., the geometry could be encoded as a WKT literal (geosparql:wktLiteral [GeoSPARQL])."@en .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                     rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution> ;
                                     rdfs:range rdfs:Literal ;
                                     rdfs:comment "El tamaño de una distribución en bytes."@es ,
                                                  "La dimensione di una distribuzione in byte."@it ,
                                                  "La taille de la distribution en octects"@fr ,
                                                  "Størrelsen af en distributionen angivet i bytes."@da ,
                                                  "The size of a distribution in bytes."@en ,
                                                  "Velikost distribuce v bajtech."@cs ,
                                                  "Το μέγεθος μιας διανομής σε bytes."@el ,
                                                  "الحجم بالبايتات "@ar ,
                                                  "バイトによる配信のサイズ。"@ja ;
                                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat/> ;
                                     rdfs:label "byte size"@en ,
                                                "bytestørrelse"@da ,
                                                "dimensione in byte"@it ,
                                                "taille en octects"@fr ,
                                                "tamaño en bytes"@es ,
                                                "velikost v bajtech"@cs ,
                                                "μέγεθος σε bytes"@el ,
                                                "الحجم بالبايت"@ar ,
                                                "バイト・サイズ"@ja ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "El tamaño de una distribución en bytes."@es ,
                                                                                      "La dimensione di una distribuzione in byte."@it ,
                                                                                      "La taille de la distribution en octects."@fr ,
                                                                                      "Størrelsen af en distribution angivet i bytes."@da ,
                                                                                      "The size of a distribution in bytes."@en ,
                                                                                      "Velikost distribuce v bajtech."@cs ,
                                                                                      "Το μέγεθος μιας διανομής σε bytes."@el ,
                                                                                      "الحجم بالبايتات "@ar ,
                                                                                      "バイトによる配信のサイズ。"@ja ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Bytestørrelsen kan approximeres hvis den præcise størrelse ikke er kendt. Værdien af dcat:byteSize bør angives som xsd:decimal."@da ,
                                                                                     "El tamaño en bytes puede ser aproximado cuando se desconoce el tamaño exacto. El valor literal de dcat:byteSize debe tener tipo 'xsd:decimal'."@es ,
                                                                                     "La dimensione in byte può essere approssimata quando non si conosce la dimensione precisa. Il valore di dcat:byteSize dovrebbe essere espresso come un xsd:decimal."@it ,
                                                                                     "La taille en octects peut être approximative lorsque l'on ignore la taille réelle. La valeur littérale de dcat:byteSize doit être de type xsd:decimal."@fr ,
                                                                                     "The size in bytes can be approximated when the precise size is not known. The literal value of dcat:byteSize should by typed as xsd:decimal."@en ,
                                                                                     "Velikost v bajtech může být přibližná, pokud její přesná hodnota není známa. Literál s hodnotou dcat:byteSize by měl mít datový typ xsd:decimal."@cs ,
                                                                                     "Το μέγεθος σε bytes μπορεί να προσεγγιστεί όταν η ακριβής τιμή δεν είναι γνωστή. Η τιμή της dcat:byteSize θα πρέπει να δίνεται με τύπο δεδομένων xsd:decimal."@el ,
                                                                                     "الحجم يمكن أن يكون تقريبي إذا كان الحجم الدقيق غير معروف"@ar ,
                                                                                     "正確なサイズが不明である場合、サイズは、バイトによる近似値を示すことができます。"@ja .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#centroid
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#centroid> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                     rdfs:domain <http://purl.org/dc/terms/Location> ;
                                     rdfs:range rdfs:Literal ;
                                     rdfs:comment "Det geometrisk tyngdepunkt (centroid) for en ressource."@da ,
                                                  "El centro geográfico (centroide) de un recurso."@es ,
                                                  "Geografický střed (centroid) zdroje."@cs ,
                                                  "Il centro geografico (centroide) di una risorsa."@it ,
                                                  "The geographic center (centroid) of a spatial thing [SDW-BP]."@en ;
                                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/> ;
                                     rdfs:label "centroid"@cs ,
                                                "centroid"@en ,
                                                "centroide"@es ,
                                                "centroide"@it ,
                                                "geometrisk tyngdepunkt"@da ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "centroide"@da ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property added in DCAT 2."@en ,
                                                                                      "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 2."@cs ,
                                                                                      "Nueva propiedad agregada en DCAT 2."@es ,
                                                                                      "Nuova proprietà aggiunta in DCAT 2."@it ,
                                                                                      "Ny egenskab tilføjet i DCAT 2."@da ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Det geometrisk tyngdepunkt (centroid) for en ressource."@da ,
                                                                                      "El centro geográfico (centroide) de un recurso."@es ,
                                                                                      "Geografický střed (centroid) zdroje."@cs ,
                                                                                      "Il centro geografico (centroide) di una risorsa."@it ,
                                                                                      "The geographic center (centroid) of a spatial thing [SDW-BP]."@en ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "English language definitions and comments updated in this revision in line with ED. Multilingual text unevenly updated."@en ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "El rango de esta propiedad es intencionalmente genérico con el objetivo de permitir distintas codificaciones geométricas. Por ejemplo, la geometría puede codificarse como WKT (geosparql:wktLiteral [GeoSPARQL]) o [GML] (geosparql:asGML [GeoSPARQL])."@es ,
                                                                                     "Il range di questa proprietà (rdfs:Literal) è volutamente generica, con lo scopo di consentire diverse codifiche geometriche letterali. Ad esempio, la geometria potrebbe essere codificata con un letterale WKT (geosparql:wktLiteral [GeoSPARQL]) o [GML] (geosparql:asGML [GeoSPARQL])."@it ,
                                                                                     "Obor hodnot této vlastnosti je úmyslně obecný, aby umožnil různé kódování geometrií. Geometrie by kupříkladu mohla být kódována jako WKT (geosparql:wktLiteral [GeoSPARQL]) či [GML] (geosparql:asGML [GeoSPARQL])."@cs ,
                                                                                     "Rækkevidden for denne egenskab er bevidst generisk definere med det formål at tillade forskellige geokodninger. Geometrien kan eksempelvis repræsenteres som WKT (geosparql:asWKT [GeoSPARQL]) eller [GML] (geosparql:asGML [GeoSPARQL])."@da ,
                                                                                     "The range of this property (rdfs:Literal) is intentionally generic, with the purpose of allowing different geometry literal encodings. E.g., the geometry could be encoded as a WKT literal (geosparql:wktLiteral [GeoSPARQL])."@en .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#endDate
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#endDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                    rdfs:domain <http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime> ;
                                    rdfs:range rdfs:Literal ;
                                    rdfs:comment "El fin del período."@es ,
                                                 "Konec doby trvání."@cs ,
                                                 "La fine del periodo."@it ,
                                                 "Slutningen på perioden."@da ,
                                                 "The end of the period."@en ;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/> ;
                                    rdfs:label "data di fine"@it ,
                                               "datum konce"@cs ,
                                               "end date"@en ,
                                               "fecha final"@es ,
                                               "slutdato"@da ;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "sluttidspunkt"@da ;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property added in DCAT 2."@en ,
                                                                                     "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 2."@cs ,
                                                                                     "Nueva propiedad agregada en DCAT 2."@es ,
                                                                                     "Nuova proprietà aggiunta in DCAT 2."@it ,
                                                                                     "Ny egenskab i DCAT 2."@da ;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "El fin del período."@es ,
                                                                                     "Konec doby trvání."@cs ,
                                                                                     "La fine del periodo."@it ,
                                                                                     "Slutningen på perioden."@da ,
                                                                                     "The end of the period."@en ;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "El rango de esta propiedad es intencionalmente genérico con el propósito de permitir distintos niveles de precisión temporal para especificar el fin del período. Por ejemplo, puede expresarse como una fecha (xsd:date), una fecha y un tiempo (xsd:dateTime), o un año (xsd:gYear)."@es ,
                                                                                    "La range di questa proprietà è volutamente generico, con lo scopo di consentire diversi livelli di precisione temporale per specificare la fine di un periodo. Ad esempio, può essere espresso con una data (xsd:date), una data e un'ora (xsd:dateTime), o un anno (xsd:gYear)."@it ,
                                                                                    "Obor hodnot této vlastnosti je úmyslně obecný, aby umožnil různé úrovně časového rozlišení pro specifikaci konce doby trvání. Ten může být kupříkladu vyjádřen datumem (xsd:date), datumem a časem (xsd:dateTime) či rokem (xsd:gYear)."@cs ,
                                                                                    "Rækkeviden for denne egenskab er bevidst generisk defineret med det formål at tillade forskellige niveauer af tidslig præcision ifm. angivelse af slutdatoen for en periode. Den kan eksempelvis udtrykkes som en dato (xsd:date), en dato og et tidspunkt (xsd:dateTime), eller et årstal (xsd:gYear)."@da ,
                                                                                    "The range of this property is intentionally generic, with the purpose of allowing different level of temporal precision for specifying the end of a period. E.g., it can be expressed with a date (xsd:date), a date and time (xsd:dateTime), or a year (xsd:gYear)."@en .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#keyword
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#keyword> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                    rdfs:range rdfs:Literal ;
                                    rdfs:comment "A keyword or tag describing a resource."@en ,
                                                 "Et nøgleord eller tag til beskrivelse af en ressource."@da ,
                                                 "Klíčové slovo nebo značka popisující zdroj."@cs ,
                                                 "Un mot-clé ou étiquette décrivant une ressource."@fr ,
                                                 "Una palabra clave o etiqueta que describe un recurso."@es ,
                                                 "Una parola chiave o un'etichetta per descrivere la risorsa."@it ,
                                                 "Μία λέξη-κλειδί ή μία ετικέτα που περιγράφει το σύνολο δεδομένων."@el ,
                                                 "كلمة  مفتاحيه توصف قائمة البيانات"@ar ,
                                                 "データセットを記述しているキーワードまたはタグ。"@ja ;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat/> ;
                                    rdfs:label "keyword"@en ,
                                               "klíčové slovo"@cs ,
                                               "mot-clés "@fr ,
                                               "nøgleord"@da ,
                                               "palabra clave"@es ,
                                               "parola chiave"@it ,
                                               "λέξη-κλειδί"@el ,
                                               "كلمة  مفتاحية "@ar ,
                                               "キーワード/タグ"@ja ;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A keyword or tag describing a resource."@en ,
                                                                                     "Et nøgleord eller tag til beskrivelse af en ressource."@da ,
                                                                                     "Klíčové slovo nebo značka popisující zdroj."@cs ,
                                                                                     "Un mot-clé ou étiquette décrivant une ressource."@fr ,
                                                                                     "Una palabra clave o etiqueta que describe un recurso."@es ,
                                                                                     "Una parola chiave o un'etichetta per descrivere la risorsa."@it ,
                                                                                     "Μία λέξη-κλειδί ή μία ετικέτα που περιγράφει το σύνολο δεδομένων."@el ,
                                                                                     "كلمة  مفتاحيه توصف قائمة البيانات"@ar ,
                                                                                     "データセットを記述しているキーワードまたはタグ。"@ja .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#spatialResolutionInMeters
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#spatialResolutionInMeters> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                      rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
                                                      rdfs:comment "mindste geografiske afstand som kan erkendes i et datasæt, målt i meter."@da ,
                                                                   "minimum spatial separation resolvable in a dataset, measured in meters."@en-us ,
                                                                   "minimum spatial separation resolvable in a dataset, measured in metres."@en-gb ,
                                                                   "minimální prostorový rozestup rozeznatelný v datové sadě, měřeno v metrech."@cs ,
                                                                   "mínima separacíon espacial disponible en un conjunto de datos, medida en metros."@es ,
                                                                   "separazione spaziale minima risolvibile in un set di dati, misurata in metri."@it ;
                                                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/> ;
                                                      rdfs:label "geografisk opløsning (meter)"@da ,
                                                                 "prostorové rozlišení (metry)"@cs ,
                                                                 "resolución espacial (metros)"@es ,
                                                                 "risoluzione spaziale (metri)"@it ,
                                                                 "spatial resolution (meters)"@en-us ,
                                                                 "spatial resolution (metres)"@en-gb ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property added in DCAT 2."@en ,
                                                                                                       "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 2."@cs ,
                                                                                                       "Nueva propiedad añadida en DCAT 2."@es ,
                                                                                                       "Nuova proprietà aggiunta in DCAT 2."@it ,
                                                                                                       "Ny genskab tilføjet i DCAT 2."@da ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "mindste geografiske afstand som kan resolveres i et datasæt, målt i meter."@da ,
                                                                                                       "minimum spatial separation resolvable in a dataset, measured in meters."@en-us ,
                                                                                                       "minimum spatial separation resolvable in a dataset, measured in metres."@en-gb ,
                                                                                                       "minimální prostorový rozestup rozeznatelný v datové sadě, měřeno v metrech."@cs ,
                                                                                                       "mínima separacíon espacial disponible en un conjunto de datos, medida en metros."@es ,
                                                                                                       "separazione spaziale minima risolvibile in un set di dati, misurata in metri."@it ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Kan optræde i forbindelse med beskrivelse af datasættet eller datasætditributionen, så der er ikke angivet et domæne for egenskaben."@da ,
                                                                                                          "Might appear in the description of a Dataset or a Distribution, so no domain is specified."@en ,
                                                                                                          "Může se vyskytnout v popisu Datové sady nebo Distribuce, takže nebyl specifikován definiční obor."@cs ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Alternative geografiske opløsninger kan leveres som forskellige datasætdistributioner."@da ,
                                                                                                      "Alternative spatial resolutions might be provided as different dataset distributions."@en ,
                                                                                                      "Distintas distribuciones de un conjunto de datos pueden tener resoluciones espaciales diferentes."@es ,
                                                                                                      "Hvis datasættet udgøres af et billede eller et grid, så bør dette svare til afstanden mellem elementerne. For andre typer af spatiale datasæt, vil denne egenskab typisk indikere den mindste afstand mellem elementerne i datasættet."@da ,
                                                                                                      "If the dataset is an image or grid this should correspond to the spacing of items. For other kinds of spatial dataset, this property will usually indicate the smallest distance between items in the dataset."@en ,
                                                                                                      "Pokud je datová sada obraz či mřížka, měla by tato vlastnost odpovídat rozestupu položek. Pro ostatní druhy prostorových datových sad bude tato vlastnost obvykle indikovat nejmenší vzdálenost mezi položkami této datové sady."@cs ,
                                                                                                      "Risoluzioni spaziali alternative possono essere fornite come diverse distribuzioni di set di dati."@it ,
                                                                                                      "Různá prostorová rozlišení mohou být poskytována jako různé distribuce datové sady."@cs ,
                                                                                                      "Se il set di dati è un'immagine o una griglia, questo dovrebbe corrispondere alla spaziatura degli elementi. Per altri tipi di set di dati spaziali, questa proprietà di solito indica la distanza minima tra gli elementi nel set di dati."@it ,
                                                                                                      "Si el conjunto de datos es una imágen o grilla, esta propiedad corresponde al espaciado de los elementos. Para otro tipo de conjunto de datos espaciales, esta propieda usualmente indica la menor distancia entre los elementos de dichos datos."@es .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#startDate
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#startDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                      rdfs:domain <http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime> ;
                                      rdfs:range rdfs:Literal ;
                                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/> ;
                                      rdfs:label "data di inizio"@it ,
                                                 "datum začátku"@cs ,
                                                 "start date"@en ,
                                                 "startdato"@da ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "starttidspunkt"@da ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property added in DCAT 2."@en ,
                                                                                       "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 2."@cs ,
                                                                                       "Nueva propiedad agregada en DCAT 2."@es ,
                                                                                       "Nuova proprietà aggiunta in DCAT 2."@it ,
                                                                                       "Ny egenskab tilføjet i DCAT 2."@da ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "El comienzo del período"@es ,
                                                                                       "L'inizio del periodo"@it ,
                                                                                       "Start på perioden."@da ,
                                                                                       "The start of the period"@en ,
                                                                                       "Začátek doby trvání"@cs ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "El rango de esta propiedad es intencionalmente genérico con el propósito de permitir distintos niveles de precisión temporal para especificar el comienzo de un período. Por ejemplo, puede expresarse como una fecha (xsd:date), una fecha y un tiempo (xsd:dateTime), o un año (xsd:gYear)."@es ,
                                                                                      "Il range di questa proprietà è volutamente generico, con lo scopo di consentire diversi livelli di precisione temporale per specificare l'inizio di un periodo. Ad esempio, può essere espresso con una data (xsd:date), una data e un'ora (xsd:dateTime), o un anno (xsd:gYear)."@it ,
                                                                                      "Obor hodnot této vlastnosti je úmyslně obecný, aby umožnil různé úrovně časového rozlišení pro specifikaci začátku doby trvání. Ten může být kupříkladu vyjádřen datumem (xsd:date), datumem a časem (xsd:dateTime) či rokem (xsd:gYear)."@cs ,
                                                                                      "Rækkeviden for denne egenskab er bevidst generisk defineret med det formål at tillade forskellige niveauer af tidslig præcision ifm. angivelse af startdatoen for en periode. Den kan eksempelvis udtrykkes som en dato (xsd:date), en dato og et tidspunkt (xsd:dateTime), eller et årstal (xsd:gYear)."@da ,
                                                                                      "The range of this property is intentionally generic, with the purpose of allowing different level of temporal precision for specifying the start of a period. E.g., it can be expressed with a date (xsd:date), a date and time (xsd:dateTime), or a year (xsd:gYear)."@en .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#temporalResolution
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#temporalResolution> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               rdfs:range xsd:duration ;
                                               rdfs:comment "mindste tidsperiode der kan resolveres i datasættet."@da ,
                                                            "minimum time period resolvable in a dataset."@en ,
                                                            "minimální doba trvání rozlišitelná v datové sadě."@cs ,
                                                            "periodo di tempo minimo risolvibile in un set di dati."@it ,
                                                            "período de tiempo mínimo en el conjunto de datos."@es ;
                                               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/> ;
                                               rdfs:label "resolución temporal"@es ,
                                                          "risoluzione temporale"@it ,
                                                          "temporal resolution"@en ,
                                                          "tidslig opløsning"@da ,
                                                          "časové rozlišení"@cs ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property added in DCAT 2."@en ,
                                                                                                "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 2."@cs ,
                                                                                                "Nueva propiedad añadida en DCAT 2."@es ,
                                                                                                "Nuova proprietà aggiunta in DCAT 2."@it ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "mindste tidsperiode der kan resolveres i datasættet."@da ,
                                                                                                "minimum time period resolvable in a dataset."@en ,
                                                                                                "minimální doba trvání rozlišitelná v datové sadě."@cs ,
                                                                                                "periodo di tempo minimo risolvibile in un set di dati."@it ,
                                                                                                "período de tiempo mínimo en el conjunto de datos."@es ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Kan optræde i forbindelse med beskrivelse af datasættet eller datasætditributionen, så der er ikke angivet et domæne for egenskaben."@da ,
                                                                                                   "Might appear in the description of a Dataset or a Distribution, so no domain is specified."@en ,
                                                                                                   "Může se vyskytnout v popisu Datové sady nebo Distribuce, takže nebyl specifikován definiční obor."@cs ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Alternative temporal resolutions might be provided as different dataset distributions."@en ,
                                                                                               "Alternative tidslige opløsninger kan leveres som forskellige datasætdistributioner."@da ,
                                                                                               "Distintas distribuciones del conjunto de datos pueden tener resoluciones temporales diferentes."@es ,
                                                                                               "Hvis datasættet er en tidsserie, så bør denne egenskab svare til afstanden mellem elementerne i tidsserien. For andre typer af datasæt indikerer denne egenskab den mindste tidsforskel mellem elementer i datasættet."@da ,
                                                                                               "If the dataset is a time-series this should correspond to the spacing of items in the series. For other kinds of dataset, this property will usually indicate the smallest time difference between items in the dataset."@en ,
                                                                                               "Pokud je datová sada časovou řadou, měla by tato vlastnost odpovídat rozestupu položek v řadě. Pro ostatní druhy datových sad bude tato vlastnost obvykle indikovat nejmenší časovou vzdálenost mezi položkami této datové sady."@cs ,
                                                                                               "Risoluzioni temporali alternative potrebbero essere fornite come diverse distribuzioni di set di dati."@it ,
                                                                                               "Různá časová rozlišení mohou být poskytována jako různé distribuce datové sady."@cs ,
                                                                                               "Se il set di dati è una serie temporale, questo dovrebbe corrispondere alla spaziatura degli elementi della serie. Per altri tipi di set di dati, questa proprietà di solito indica la più piccola differenza di tempo tra gli elementi nel set di dati."@it ,
                                                                                               "Si el conjunto de datos es una serie temporal, debe corresponder al espaciado de los elementos de la serie. Para otro tipo de conjuntos de datos, esta propiedad indicará usualmente la menor diferencia de tiempo entre elementos en el dataset."@es .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#version
<http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#version> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                    rdfs:comment "El indicador de versión (nombre o identificador) del recurso."@es ,
                                                 "L'indicatore di versione (un nome o un identificatore) di una risorsa."@it ,
                                                 "The version indicator (name or identifier) of a resource."@en ;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-3/> ;
                                    rdfs:label "version"@en ,
                                               "versione"@it ,
                                               "versión"@es ;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "New property added in DCAT 3."@en ,
                                                                                     "Nová vlastnost přidaná ve verzi DCAT 3."@cs ,
                                                                                     "Nueva propiedad agregada in DCAT 3."@es ,
                                                                                     "Nuova proprietà aggiunta in DCAT 3."@it ,
                                                                                     "Ny egenskab tilføjet i DCAT 3."@da ;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "El indicador de versión (nombre o identificador) del recurso."@es ,
                                                                                     "L'indicatore di versione (un nome o un identificatore) di una risorsa"@it ,
                                                                                     "The version indicator (name or identifier) of a resource."@en ;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "DCAT does not prescribe how a version name / identifier should be specified, and refers for guidance to [DWBP]'s Best Practice 7: Provide a version indicator."@en ,
                                                                                    "DCAT no prescribe cómo especificar el nombre or identificador de una versión, y como guía sugiere leer las práctica 7 en [DWBP] sobre cómo proveer un indicador de versión"@es ,
                                                                                    "DCAT non prescrive come un nome o identificatore di versione dovrebbe essere specificato, e fa riferimento alle linee guida indicate in [DWBP] Best Practice 7: Provide a version indicator."@it .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#atTime
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#atTime> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#InstantaneousEvent> ;
                                   rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
                                   rdfs:comment "The time at which an InstantaneousEvent occurred, in the form of xsd:dateTime."@en ;
                                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o#> ;
                                   rdfs:label "atTime" ;
                                   <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#category> "qualified" ;
                                   <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#component> "entities-activities" ;
                                   <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#sharesDefinitionWith> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#InstantaneousEvent> ;
                                   <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#unqualifiedForm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#endedAtTime> ,
                                                                               <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generatedAtTime> ,
                                                                               <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#invalidatedAtTime> ,
                                                                               <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#startedAtTime> .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#endedAtTime
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#endedAtTime> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                        rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> ;
                                        rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
                                        rdfs:comment "The time at which an activity ended. See also prov:startedAtTime."@en ;
                                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o#> ;
                                        rdfs:label "endedAtTime" ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#category> "starting-point" ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#component> "entities-activities" ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#editorialNote> "It is the intent that the property chain holds: (prov:qualifiedEnd o prov:atTime) rdfs:subPropertyOf prov:endedAtTime."@en ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedForm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#End> ,
                                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#atTime> .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generatedAtTime
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generatedAtTime> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                            rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> ;
                                            rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
                                            rdfs:comment "The time at which an entity was completely created and is available for use."@en ;
                                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o#> ;
                                            rdfs:label "generatedAtTime" ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#category> "expanded" ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#component> "entities-activities" ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#editorialNote> "It is the intent that the property chain holds: (prov:qualifiedGeneration o prov:atTime) rdfs:subPropertyOf prov:generatedAtTime."@en ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedForm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Generation> ,
                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#atTime> .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#invalidatedAtTime
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#invalidatedAtTime> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                              rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> ;
                                              rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
                                              rdfs:comment "The time at which an entity was invalidated (i.e., no longer usable)."@en ;
                                              rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o#> ;
                                              rdfs:label "invalidatedAtTime" ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#category> "expanded" ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#component> "entities-activities" ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#editorialNote> "It is the intent that the property chain holds: (prov:qualifiedInvalidation o prov:atTime) rdfs:subPropertyOf prov:invalidatedAtTime."@en ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedForm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Invalidation> ,
                                                                                        <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#atTime> .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#startedAtTime
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#startedAtTime> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                          rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> ;
                                          rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
                                          rdfs:comment "The time at which an activity started. See also prov:endedAtTime."@en ;
                                          rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o#> ;
                                          rdfs:label "startedAtTime" ;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#category> "starting-point" ;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#component> "entities-activities" ;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#editorialNote> "It is the intent that the property chain holds: (prov:qualifiedStart o prov:atTime) rdfs:subPropertyOf prov:startedAtTime."@en ;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedForm> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Start> ,
                                                                                    <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#atTime> .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#value
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#value> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                  rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> ;
                                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o#> ;
                                  rdfs:label "value" ;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#category> "expanded" ;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#component> "entities-activities" ;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#definition> "Provides a value that is a direct representation of an entity."@en ;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#dm> "http://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-dm-20130430/#term-attribute-value"^^xsd:anyURI ;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#editorialNote> "This property serves the same purpose as rdf:value, but has been reintroduced to avoid some of the definitional ambiguity in the RDF specification (specifically, 'may be used in describing structured values')."@en ,
                                                                            "The editor's definition comes from http://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-primer/#rdfvalue" .


###  http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/family_name
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/family_name> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This is the property we choose to use to describe the family name of a person related to a bibliographic resource."@en .


###  http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/givenname
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/givenname> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This is the property we choose to describe the given name of a Person related to a bibliographic resource. This is the first name of a person."@en .


###  http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://schema.org/codeRepository
<https://schema.org/codeRepository> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://schema.org/conditionsOfAccess
<https://schema.org/conditionsOfAccess> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://schema.org/description
<https://schema.org/description> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://schema.org/endDate
<https://schema.org/endDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://schema.org/identifier
<https://schema.org/identifier> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://schema.org/startDate
<https://schema.org/startDate> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://schema.org/url
<https://schema.org/url> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://schema.org/value
<https://schema.org/value> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://schema.org/version
<https://schema.org/version> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/accessLevel
:accessLevel rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://schema.org/conditionsOfAccess> ;
             rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> ;
             rdfs:range xsd:string ;
             rdfs:comment "Access classification of the dataset. Recommended controlled vocabulary: 'open', 'restricted', 'embargoed', 'closed'."@en ;
             rdfs:label "access level"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/activityDescription
:activityDescription rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                     rdfs:domain :ResearchActivity ;
                     rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                     rdfs:comment "A prose description of what this research activity involved."@en ;
                     rdfs:label "activity description"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/activityEnd
:activityEnd rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#endedAtTime> ,
                                <https://schema.org/endDate> ;
             rdfs:domain :ResearchActivity ;
             rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
             rdfs:comment "ISO 8601 datetime at which this activity ended."@en ;
             rdfs:label "activity end"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/activityStart
:activityStart rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
               rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#startedAtTime> ,
                                  <https://schema.org/startDate> ;
               rdfs:domain :ResearchActivity ;
               rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
               rdfs:comment "ISO 8601 datetime at which this activity began."@en ;
               rdfs:label "activity start"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/checksum
:checksum rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
          rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> ;
          rdfs:range xsd:string ;
          rdfs:comment "A cryptographic checksum (e.g. SHA-256) of the dataset file to enable integrity verification during reproduction. Format: '<algorithm>:<hex>', e.g. 'sha256:e3b0c44298fc1c149afb...'."@en ;
          rdfs:label "checksum"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/commitHash
:commitHash rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
            rdfs:domain :SoftwareApplication ;
            rdfs:range xsd:string ;
            rdfs:comment "The exact VCS commit SHA at which this software version was recorded, e.g. 'a3f9b2c'. More precise than a semantic version tag for reproducibility."@en ;
            rdfs:label "commit hash"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/cpuCores
:cpuCores rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
          rdfs:domain :ComputingEnvironment ;
          rdfs:range xsd:integer ;
          rdfs:comment "Number of CPU cores available in this environment."@en ;
          rdfs:label "CPU cores"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/cudaVersion
:cudaVersion rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:domain :ComputingEnvironment ;
             rdfs:range xsd:string ;
             rdfs:comment "CUDA toolkit version string, e.g. '12.2.2'. Required when GPU acceleration is used; different CUDA versions can alter numerical results."@en ;
             rdfs:label "CUDA version"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/dataFormat
:dataFormat rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
            rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/dataLicense
:dataLicense rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> ;
             rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/datasetLandingPage
:datasetLandingPage rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                    rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://schema.org/url> ;
                    rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> ;
                    rdfs:range xsd:anyURI ;
                    rdfs:comment "A URI pointing to the human-readable landing page for this dataset in its repository. Kept as a DatatypeProperty with xsd:anyURI range to avoid the range conflict between dcat:landingPage (foaf:Document) and xsd:anyURI."@en ;
                    rdfs:label "dataset landing page"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/dependencyName
:dependencyName rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/dependencyType
:dependencyType rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                rdfs:domain :SoftwareDependency ;
                rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                rdfs:comment "The role of this dependency. Recommended values: 'runtime', 'build', 'optional', 'test'."@en ;
                rdfs:label "dependency type"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/dependencyVersion
:dependencyVersion rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                   rdfs:domain :SoftwareDependency ;
                   rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                   rdfs:comment "The exact (pinned) version string of this dependency, e.g. '2.1.0', '1.24.3'. Pin to the exact version for reproducibility, not a range."@en ;
                   rdfs:label "dependency version"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/description
:description rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> ,
                                <https://schema.org/description> ;
             rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> ;
             rdfs:range xsd:string ;
             rdfs:comment "A free-text description of the entity."@en ;
             rdfs:label "description"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/evaluationDate
:evaluationDate rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                rdfs:domain :EvaluationResult ;
                rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
                rdfs:comment "ISO 8601 datetime at which this evaluation was performed."@en ;
                rdfs:label "evaluation date"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/fundingReference
:fundingReference rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                  rdfs:domain :ResearchProject ;
                  rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                  rdfs:comment "Grant or award identifier(s) funding this project, e.g. 'NSF-2012345' or 'ERC-StG-123456'."@en ;
                  rdfs:label "funding reference"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/gpuModel
:gpuModel rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
          rdfs:domain :ComputingEnvironment ;
          rdfs:range xsd:string ;
          rdfs:comment "GPU model name and VRAM, e.g. 'NVIDIA A100 80GB', '4x NVIDIA RTX 4090 24GB'."@en ;
          rdfs:label "GPU model"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/hardwareSpec
:hardwareSpec rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
              rdfs:domain :ComputingEnvironment ;
              rdfs:range xsd:string ;
              rdfs:comment "Human-readable hardware description, e.g. 'NVIDIA A100 80GB SXM4, Intel Xeon Gold 6338, 512 GB RAM'."@en ;
              rdfs:label "hardware specification"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/identifier
:identifier rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
            rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> ,
                               <https://schema.org/identifier> ;
            rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> ;
            rdfs:range xsd:string ;
            rdfs:comment "A persistent identifier string for any prov:Entity, e.g. a DOI, ORCID, ROR, Handle, or local UUID."@en ;
            rdfs:label "identifier"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/imageDigest
:imageDigest rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:domain :EnvironmentSpec ;
             rdfs:range xsd:string ;
             rdfs:comment "The content-addressable digest of a container image, e.g. 'sha256:a7f3b2c...' for a Docker image. Guarantees bit-for-bit environment identity."@en ;
             rdfs:label "image digest"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/methodDoi
:methodDoi rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
           rdfs:domain :Method ;
           rdfs:range xsd:anyURI ;
           rdfs:comment "A DOI or URL pointing to an externally published description of this method or protocol (e.g. a protocols.io entry, a paper describing the workflow)."@en ;
           rdfs:label "method DOI"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/metricDataType
:metricDataType rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                rdfs:domain :EvaluationResult ;
                rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                rdfs:comment "XSD type of the metric value, e.g. 'xsd:float'. Allows consumers to parse rdip:metricValue correctly."@en ;
                rdfs:label "metric data type"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/metricName
:metricName rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
            rdfs:domain :EvaluationResult ;
            rdfs:range xsd:string ;
            rdfs:comment "The name of the evaluation metric, e.g. 'accuracy', 'F1-macro', 'RMSE', 'AUC-ROC', 'BLEU', 'perplexity'."@en ;
            rdfs:label "metric name"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/metricValue
:metricValue rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:domain :EvaluationResult ;
             rdfs:range xsd:string ;
             rdfs:comment "The numeric value of the metric as a string, e.g. '0.9432'. Use string to preserve significant figures; rdip:metricDataType declares the actual type."@en ;
             rdfs:label "metric value"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/orcidId
:orcidId rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
         rdfs:domain <http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Person> ;
         rdfs:range xsd:anyURI ;
         rdfs:comment "The ORCID persistent identifier URI for a researcher, e.g. 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1825-0097'. Use xsd:anyURI typed literals in instance data."@en ;
         rdfs:label "ORCID iD"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/osVersion
:osVersion rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
           rdfs:domain :ComputingEnvironment ;
           rdfs:range xsd:string ;
           rdfs:comment "Operating system name and version, e.g. 'Ubuntu 22.04.3 LTS', 'macOS 14.2.1'."@en ;
           rdfs:label "OS version"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/parameterDataType
:parameterDataType rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                   rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
                   rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                   rdfs:comment "The XSD datatype or informal type of the parameter value, e.g. 'xsd:float', 'xsd:integer', 'xsd:string'. Allows consumers to correctly parse rdip:parameterValue."@en ;
                   rdfs:label "parameter data type"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/parameterName
:parameterName rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
               rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/parameterValue
:parameterValue rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://schema.org/value> ;
                rdfs:domain :Parameter ;
                rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                rdfs:comment "The value of the parameter as a string to accommodate both numeric ('0.001', '32') and symbolic ('Adam', 'relu') values."@en ;
                rdfs:label "parameter value"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/projectEnd
:projectEnd rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
            rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://schema.org/endDate> ;
            rdfs:domain :ResearchProject ;
            rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
            rdfs:comment "ISO 8601 datetime at which the project officially ended."@en ;
            rdfs:label "project end"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/projectStart
:projectStart rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
              rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://schema.org/startDate> ;
              rdfs:domain :ResearchProject ;
              rdfs:range xsd:dateTime ;
              rdfs:comment "ISO 8601 datetime at which the project officially began."@en ;
              rdfs:label "project start"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/ramGB
:ramGB rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
       rdfs:domain :ComputingEnvironment ;
       rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
       rdfs:comment "Total RAM in gigabytes available in this environment."@en ;
       rdfs:label "RAM (GB)"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/repositoryUrl
:repositoryUrl rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
               rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://schema.org/codeRepository> ;
               rdfs:domain :SoftwareApplication ;
               rdfs:range xsd:anyURI ;
               rdfs:comment "URL of the version-controlled source code repository (e.g. GitHub, GitLab) for this software."@en ;
               rdfs:label "repository URL"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/roleLabel
:roleLabel rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
           rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/rorId
:rorId rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
       rdfs:domain <http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Organization> ;
       rdfs:range xsd:anyURI ;
       rdfs:comment "The Research Organization Registry (ROR) URI for an Organisation, e.g. 'https://ror.org/02mhbdp94'. Use xsd:anyURI typed literals in instance data."@en ;
       rdfs:label "ROR identifier"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/softwareLicense
:softwareLicense rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                 rdfs:domain :SoftwareApplication ;
                 rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/specType
:specType rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
          rdfs:domain :EnvironmentSpec ;
          rdfs:range xsd:string ;
          rdfs:comment "The type of environment specification. Recommended values: 'docker', 'conda', 'pip-requirements', 'nix', 'singularity', 'spack'."@en ;
          rdfs:label "specification type"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/specUri
:specUri rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
         rdfs:domain :EnvironmentSpec ;
         rdfs:range xsd:anyURI ;
         rdfs:comment "A dereferenceable URI pointing to the environment spec file, e.g. a raw GitHub URL to environment.yml or a Docker Hub image reference."@en ;
         rdfs:label "specification URI"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/splitLabel
:splitLabel rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
            rdfs:domain :EvaluationResult ;
            rdfs:range xsd:string ;
            rdfs:comment "The dataset split on which this metric was measured, e.g. 'train', 'validation', 'test', 'hold-out'. Essential context for comparing reproduction results."@en ;
            rdfs:label "split label"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/title
:title rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
       rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/version
:version rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
         rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://schema.org/version> ;
         rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> ;
         rdfs:range xsd:string ;
         rdfs:comment "The version string of this entity, e.g. '1.3.2' (semver) or a Git commit SHA. For full version chains also use rdip:isVersionOf."@en ;
         rdfs:label "version"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/workflowLanguage
:workflowLanguage rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                  rdfs:domain :Method ;
                  rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                  rdfs:comment "The formal workflow language used to specify this method, e.g. 'CWL', 'Nextflow', 'Snakemake', 'WDL'. Leave empty for informal narrative protocols."@en ;
                  rdfs:label "workflow language"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/rdip/workflowUri
:workflowUri rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:domain :Method ;
             rdfs:range xsd:anyURI ;
             rdfs:comment "URI pointing to the formal workflow definition file (CWL, Nextflow, etc.) for this method."@en ;
             rdfs:label "workflow URI"@en .


#################################################################
#    Classes
#################################################################

###  http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#area
<http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#area> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeAGROVOC> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeDBPediaID> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeFAOSTAT> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeFAOTERM> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeGAUL> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeISO2> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeISO3> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeUN> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#codeUNDP> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameListAR> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameListEN> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameListES> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameListFR> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameListIT> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameListRU> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameListZH> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameOfficialAR> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameOfficialEN> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameOfficialES> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameOfficialFR> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameOfficialIT> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <http://aims.fao.org/aos/geopolitical.owl#nameOfficialRU> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ,
