###  http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slideshow
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slideshow> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                          rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Document> ,
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
