###  http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Course
<http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#Course> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                          rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.org/NET/c4dm/event.owl#Event> ,
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
